-                     pooled 12/19 = 0.63, but n=19 is too small; 0.43 is ~ its lower 95% bound.
-    rebalance_add  : entry x units x (ATR_d% x sqrt(hold_days)) x MOVE_HAIRCUT
-                     daily ATR(14) as % of price, hold default 20 trading days,
-                     MOVE_HAIRCUT 0.25 (expected directional edge = 1/4 of the 1-sigma move).
-    trim / sell    : caller supplies expected_gain_usd + method (replacement edge or risk
